@base = http://localhost:3000

### Health
GET {{base}}/health

### List customers (copy an id for the requests below)
GET {{base}}/customers

### 
GET {{base}}/customers/nope/work-orders

###
POST {{base}}/customers
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Joseph Schmidt", "email": "joseph.schmidt@test.com", "phone": 9163220989}

### Create a work order
POST {{base}}/work-orders
Content-Type: application/json

{ "customerId": "e6fb67b8-c0a6-467a-9d43-d24265adb83f", "jobType": "repair", "formData": { "description": "Loose jack", "urgency": "rush" } }

### Illegal transition, expect 409
PATCH {{base}}/work-orders/0ce71744-bf83-415e-baf9-2f03d562efa8/status
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "DONE" }